</head> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <argument>     <p rendition="#c">Tivoli &#x2014; Streit &#x2014; <hi rendition="#aq">Isola bella</hi> &#x2014; die Kinder&#x017F;tube<lb/>
